# hephaestus_forge Python

- Planner LLM defaults to Ultra `nvidia/nemotron-3-ultra-550b-a55b` via NIM; Lightning is the fast parallel peer.
- Dual coding: `cloud/parallel_nim.py` + `forge nim-parallel` — Ultra plans, Lightning implements (concurrent).
- Mission Control `/agent/*` only works on a live `forge observe` process; path args with spaces must be quoted.
- When LLM is requested, do not hide NIM 404/503 behind quiet heuristic — keep `llm_error` visible.
- Prefer adding pytest for command JSON shapes and model id aliases over manual-only checks.
